    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so empty. like if the \"me\" everyone knew is gone, then what am i even doing here? just taking up space? it feels like i'm just a shell of something that used to exist. i don't even see a point in trying to \"move forward\" into a life that feels this hollow.",
