      "content": "I get it, it feels like you're trapped in a shell, but you're still here, still alive. Maybe it's time to redefine what \"moving forward\" means to you. You don't have to rush it, but maybe you can start by finding small things that bring you even the tiniest bit of joy or comfort. It's not about filling the void, but about finding new ways to fill your own space, even if it's just a little at a time. You don't have to go through this alone, even if it feels like it now.",
